* Fixed the Tableau Desktop (Windows) Fleet-maintained app never being detected as installed. Its exists and patched queries matched the publisher `Tableau Software, LLC` from the winget manifest, but Tableau registers `Salesforce, Inc` in the Windows registry, so hosts with Tableau Desktop installed reported it as missing and its patch policy always reported "patched". Also fixed the app's "is open" check, which matched a process named `tableau desktop.exe` that the installer never creates; it now matches the real executable, `tableau.exe`.
